- CLI options:
  - --out / -o: path to log file (default shown above)
  - --interval / -i: polling interval in seconds (default 0.5)
  - --no-duplicates: record every poll (do not skip consecutive duplicates)
  - --include-empty: include empty/whitespace-only clipboard contents
  - --max-size / -m: rotate the log when it reaches this size (human-friendly, e.g. 5M)
  - --verbose / -v: print actions to stdout
